sequenceDiagram
    actor Dev as Developer
    participant GH as GitHub Actions<br/>(ubuntu-latest)
    participant DH as Docker Hub
    participant PG as Postgres<br/>(via SSH)

    Dev->>GH: push to main
    GH->>GH: setup, run-tests<br/>(gradlew test, spotlessCheck)
    Note over GH: run-tests gates every job below

    par build-and-push-docker-image
        GH->>GH: derive tag main-N-sha7<br/>(sortable by N)
        GH->>DH: build linux/amd64, push<br/>app and app-nonprod tags
    and flyway-verify, flyway-verify-nonprod
        GH->>PG: SSH forward,<br/>pinned host key
        GH->>PG: Flyway migrate this commit<br/>on the real database
    end

    Note over GH,DH: ends at image push,<br/>deploys are pull-based (image-to-rollout)
